 * Performs a right node rotation.
 *
 * <p>After the rotation the left child of {@code node} becomes the new parent,
 * {@code node} becomes the right child of that new parent, and the right subtree
 * of the new parent (if any) becomes the left subtree of {@code node}.
 *
 * @param node a node to rotate
 * @return the new parent of {@code node}
